@baseUrl = https://localhost:7077
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
@module = daily-life
@runId = PASTE_RUN_ID

### Reading overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reading
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Start or resume a module (complete-words / daily-life / academic-passage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reading/{{module}}/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Next accessible activity; answer keys are not returned before submission
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reading/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/steps/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Submit once; keep this UUID for retries of this submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reading/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/steps/1/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "submissionId": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
  "answers": { "1": "A", "2": "C" }
}

### History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reading/{{module}}/runs?skip=0&take=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restart only after 100% completion
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reading/{{module}}/runs/{{runId}}/restart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
